# .claude/: track the shared settings, hooks, commands and agents; ignore local state.
# The leading `!.claude/` re-includes the directory when a global gitignore ignores it.
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/agents/
